          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "انطباع — inṭibāʿ — \"an impression\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ترك الفندق انطباعا جيدا عندي. taraka al-funduq inṭibāʿan jayyidan ʿindī. The hotel left a good impression on me."
            }
          ]
        },
