              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منظور — manẓūr — \"a perspective\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "من منظور الطبيب، النوم مهم جدا. min manẓūr aṭ-ṭabīb, an-nawm muhimm jiddan. From the doctor's perspective, sleep is very important."
            }
          ]
        },
