          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "افترض (iftaraḍa) is built on the native Arabic root f-r-ḍ, \"to make a notch; to make binding\" (Lane). It is Form VIII: to take a thing as laid down, to assume it."
